&_nc_oc=AdlOJ6_ig7cn1ZGUhXuLWch5Gm0qD19SDp8TvLw67C7WRSYJjPbU_gnGMIGsyz5xqp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsR5h-QyOlcIywS1GgQBmoHMxeNiKOz668yV5etAIGUew&oe=69A581E6"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1488377815132033", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1488377818465366_4369730771137685134_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CmX6kxlXneUQ7kNvwFYTs-q&_nc_oc=AdkVrY7QEB5eKUbG7WIfZ0u11H1pJT-aBefwHdbvpbsRBbT2WcFLxfXBuAvZIHWuI-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs25-xo2i7Q7uoJkHhCDJ3HOyYb9cKQq9BjfSv76i11Yg&oe=69A57E44"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "414882827722865", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982480_414882831056198_2207792374391745331_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eY2n5cH6ynUQ7kNvwEYY6_-&_nc_oc=Admb9LiyZOAf2ptwZtNN9GxXVb7FU778KpLXOxtZydVvkB6TnQ49rwVRxbn_fy-iJfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftyr1b-yvmhiSqItEgR_wG-rvBJQgkAiMJo0i1u24KKgQ&oe=69A5717D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16x9-2.png", "id": "811607170639171", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86609236_811607173972504_8101196321901847264_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=794KW0lEv-MQ7kNvwEVnAl3&_nc_oc=AdniWQTKnPU6PbaRRlkN5Wsj5nGdcM3corXVqNG9oHHoJeAQuDt9fjxcsglgtpnzRxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv4IJNUf3iYQW3vdt8Vag39jaDff5gTaXEDvSlo-Mu3Jw&oe=69A59E81"}, "display_name": "Void Ninja Demo", "keywords": ["action", "platformer", "ninja", "void", "runner"], "long_description": "Void Ninja is an **action platformer** game that blends runner elements with a unique **\u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion**.  \n\n\ud83d\udc49Gameplay: You're **always on the move and can't stop**. Use your hips and shoulders to steer on the path. Overcome obstacles and clear out enemies.   \n\n\ud83d\udc49**Just one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!*** \nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow.  \n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77  \n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Unique natural flow locomotion:**   \nInspired by the \"Jinba Ittai\" philosophy, this system ensures perfect unity between player and the game - you simply act as you would in real life  \n\u2796  \n- **Comfort / Motion sickness tested:**  \n 85% of players experienced no symptoms, 10% adapted after 30 minutes, and 5% did not adjust and we prefer not to talk about them  \n\u2796 \n- **Platformer / runner:**   \nFirst-person platforming adventure inspired by a certain blue hedgehog. Intense combats,  adrenaline-pumping jumps and jet-powered flights - this game will keep your heart racing   \n \u2796 \n- **Combat dance:**   \nAs you progress, you'll develop your own unique moves and combos crafted by your skill, not pre-made by the developers  \n \u2796\n- **Level reassembly:**   \nEach time you load a level, it\u2019s generated in a new and unique way   \n\n\n\n\ud83e\udea7**4 demo levels**   \n\u279517 extra levesl available in the paid supporter version\n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77 \n\nThis is work in progress version.\n**Share your thoughts, ideas and feedback with us** - let's make the game together.\n\n*rarely its 2 buttons, but you won't confuse them. Only 1 sounds better, right?\n", "short_description": "Action platformer with gesture based controls and unique locomotion."}]}, "developer_name": "Roman Yakimenko", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://void-ninja.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Magic Web Solutions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://void-ninja.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "